				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Remittimus praefationem in ea tibi<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>tibi fehlt in E.</hi></note>, de quibus convenit inter nos<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Die Rede ist vom einleitenden Teil des an der Tagung vom 12.-14. November aufgesetzten Schreibens an <persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> (s. oben <ref target="file10953">Nr. 911</ref>, Anm. 1).</note>, ut <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>mittatur<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>E:</hi> mittantur.</note> pro concordia conficienda ad doctorem <persName ref="p1974">Martinum Lutherum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>hanc quidem ob causam, quod ea reperta est tam manca et obscura<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>E:</hi> obscura <hi>über gestrichenem</hi> mutila.</note>, ut, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quid contineat, vel ipsi nesciamus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">At <persName ref="p1974">Luthero</persName><note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>E:</hi> Luthero vero <hi>anstelle von</hi> At Luthero.</note> tam hic nihil respon<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sum ad suos articulos<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Gemeint ist die <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberger</placeName> Konkordie (<bibl source="b135">BucerDS</bibl> VI/1 114-134).</note>, ut totam scriptionem quis ceu frustraneam cul<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>pare posset<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f"><hi>E:</hi> culpare posset <hi>über gestrichenem</hi> iudicare quis valeret.</note>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Simul hic consenseramus omnes articulos nobis placere, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>si mens foret<note xml:id="fng" type="footnote" n="g"><hi>E:</hi> esset.</note>, qualem Argentinens[ium] exponeret declaratio<note xml:id="fnh" type="footnote" n="h"><hi>E: nach</hi> declaratio <hi>gestrichenes</hi> promeret; <hi>ersetzt durch das am Rande nachgetragene</hi> exponeret.</note><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Nämlich die an der Tagung vom 24./25. September in <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> vorgetragene Erklärung <persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> und <persName ref="p5565">Capitos</persName> (<bibl source="b135">BucerDS</bibl> VI/1 227-239).</note>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Nihil fere <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tale nunc in exemplari nostro comperimus, scriptorum credimus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>vicio, qui te dictantem perperam acceperunt.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Emendavit igitur illam <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>scriba nostrae civitatis primarius<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p2804">Heinrich Ryhiner</persName>.</note> hanccine formam induens, quam cernis<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Original: Zürich ZB, Ms S 41, 164 (mit Randbemerkungen von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand); vgl. das Zitat unten <ref target="file10967">Nr. 925</ref>, 32-35.</note>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Ergo<note xml:id="fni" type="footnote" n="i"><hi>E:</hi> Ea si fuerit igitur.</note> ea si fuerit<note xml:id="fnk" type="footnote" n="k"><hi>E:</hi> Ea si fuerit igitur.</note> tuo similis descripto<note xml:id="fnl" type="footnote" n="l"><hi>E:</hi> descripto <hi>anstelle von gestrichenem</hi> exemplari <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Siehe ebd., Anm. 8f.</note>, bene res habet.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sin <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>alia, cupimus id indicari nobis.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quamvis interim nihil dubitemus, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>quin, quod mittimus, haudquaquam<note xml:id="fnm" type="footnote" n="m"><hi>E:</hi> displicere nequaquam possit.</note> possit displicere<note xml:id="fnn" type="footnote" n="n"><hi>E:</hi> displicere nequaquam possit.</note>, cum sententiam exprimat, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quam semel omnes adprobavimus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Voluimus haec ad te scribere, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>non ad senatum, ne huic<pb type="edition" next="489"/> essemus molesti, et quod exemplar inveniri <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>apud te integrum iudicavimus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quodsi opus esse videbitur ampliore <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>consultatione, tuae concedimus prudentiae, modo<note xml:id="fno" type="footnote" n="o">in <hi>E korrigiert aus:</hi> modo recte omnia et in tempore fiant.</note> fiant in tempore o<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>mnia<note xml:id="fnp" type="footnote" n="p">in <hi>E korrigiert aus:</hi> modo recte omnia et in tempore fiant.</note>, prout novit dexteritas tua disponere<note xml:id="fnq" type="footnote" n="q"><hi>E:</hi> diiudicare <hi>(über gestrichenem</hi> facere).</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Praeterea <placeName ref="l41">Bernenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>tam responderunt inepte super<note xml:id="fnr" type="footnote" n="r"><hi>E: de.</hi></note> non mittendo scripto ad <persName ref="p1974">Lutherum</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Siehe oben <ref target="file10961">Nr. 919</ref>.</note> ut <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>nemo<note xml:id="fns" type="footnote" n="s"><hi>E:</hi> sit fere.</note>, sit, qui non stupeat.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Et quid egimus hactenus, si non curamus<note xml:id="fnt" type="footnote" n="t"><hi>E:</hi> nolumus <hi>anstelle von</hi> non curamus.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>concordiam cum <persName ref="p1974">Luthero</persName>, sed cum <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensibus</placeName>?</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Putant fortas<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>se negocium<note xml:id="fnu" type="footnote" n="u"><hi>E:</hi> sic negocium habere, quemadmodum in foederibus illis.</note> esse, qualia sunt foedera<note xml:id="fnv" type="footnote" n="v"><hi>E:</hi> sic negocium habere, quemadmodum in foederibus illis.</note> saeculi huius.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Utinam persuadeantur, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ut mutent sententiam!</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Quodsi tamen fieri non poterit, equidem i<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ntelligo nostros in re tam sancta perrecturos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum<note xml:id="fnw" type="footnote" n="w"><hi>fehlt in E.</hi></note> tuis et fratribus<note xml:id="fnx" type="footnote" n="x"><hi>fehlt in E.</hi></note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName><note xml:id="fny" type="footnote" n="y">E: 1536, 3. decembris.</note>, 3. decembris anno 1536<note xml:id="fnz" type="footnote" n="z">E: 1536, 3. decembris.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8418">Os. My<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>conius</persName><note xml:id="fnaa" type="footnote" n="aa"><hi>Die Unterschrift fehlt in E.</hi></note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]<note xml:id="fnab" type="footnote" n="ab"><hi>Darüber (von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand?):</hi> Domini <persName ref="p8418">Osvaldi Myconii</persName> epistolae. <hi>Der Entwurf trägt auf der Rückseite die Adresse:</hi> <persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName> suo senatus nomine; <hi>darunter ein Regest von späterer Hand.</hi></note></note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bul<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>lingero</persName> pientissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>in domino fratri per<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>quam venerando.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Z[ür]ich</placeName><note xml:id="fnac" type="footnote" n="ac"><hi>Über den (nicht mehr erhaltenen) Verschlußstreifen geschrieben.</hi></note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
